{"overview":"نوریکو دانش‌آموز عادی دبیرستانی است تا اینکه انفجاری او را به دنیایی جادویی می‌کشاند که هیچ‌کس زبان او را نمی‌فهمد. کاملاً گم‌گشته، نوریکو توسط ایزاک، شمشیرزنی که از جامعه طرد شده و مصمم به کشتن بیداری است—شخصیتی پیشگویی‌شده که گفته می‌شود شیطان آسمان را کنترل می‌کند—نجات می‌یابد. همان‌طور که ایزاک و نوریکو پیوند می‌خورند، او متوجه می‌شود که شاید نوریکو همان کسی باشد که به دنبالش می‌گردد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Noriko is an ordinary high school student, until an explosion pulls her into a world of magic where no one speaks her language. Completely lost, Noriko is rescued by Izark, a shunned swordsman determined to kill the Awakening: a prophesied figure said to control the Sky Demon. As Izark and Noriko bond, he realizes she may be the very person he’s hunting.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2026,"poster":"/rHI61poyqC6GF0HRurV6Hq12K81.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"黒沢ともよ","role":"Noriko Tachiki (voice)","photo":"/eSRnva88YVcUXlDHdVrhier2SGU.jpg","en":"Tomoyo Kurosawa"},{"name":"熊谷健太郎","role":"Izark Kia Tarj (voice)","photo":"/hsSdTc4PBuLOQedZMsTS6AHvC8l.jpg","en":"Kentaro Kumagai"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Rachef (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"竹内栄治","role":"Keimos Lee Goda (voice)","photo":"/1qMbZGM7i9oEiHQvInY14UNZ2gk.jpg","en":"Eiji Takeuchi"},{"name":"斉藤貴美子","role":"Gaya (voice)","photo":"/rPP0jCjtLuEEroY3e2aRT8zonYK.jpg","en":"Kimiko Saito"},{"name":"宮澤正","role":"Gorya (voice)","photo":"/oTKVqD3r6j4d264ifrxoH1ibxDb.jpg","en":"Tadashi Miyazawa"},{"name":"中野泰佑","role":"Agol (voice)","photo":"/zBNyZKcQzNO59Z66LK9e2AKSLWl.jpg","en":"Taisuke Nakano"},{"name":"伊藤美来","role":"Gina Haas (voice)","photo":"/q2y0SbBKNeVLf5obxixFmmiM4hQ.jpg","en":"Miku Ito"}],"trailer":"KvAT3meev84","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/329096/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll